{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Decimal exactness is opt-in: bare literals are double (0.1 + 0.2 → 0.30000…4),\nso for exact decimal arithmetic both operands are cast `as number/decimal`. Pins\nthat decimal operands stay decimal and add exactly (0.1 + 0.2 = 0.3).",
